Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as we begin the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, for many parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it's also a time where there are a lot of expenses for school
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and we want our kids to have the best start in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have things like schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and other expenses that parents have to fork out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And during these times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you have cost of living concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,challenging times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we want to help parents from low-income families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to support their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,MENDAKI is introducing the Ready for School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,e-voucher initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,which we hope to help kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,from Primary One all the way up to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, MENDAKI is giving out $250 e-vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents can use for their children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it's schoolbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it is stationery or even shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's important because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,especially for parents who have more than one child
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, sometimes you have two or three kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's always challenging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to try to fork out that much expense at one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pegging it at about $1,000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,per capita income and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So we expect more than 22,000 students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,who could benefit from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is in addition to about 13,000 others
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that typically benefit from our TTFS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and other MENDAKI schemes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an application basis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and we start to take applications from 1st December.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So we hope that this will do its part
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to help parents and children
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,have a good start for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to worry about some of these expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have otherwise held them back.
